@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Disclaimer";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Read the RatPDF disclaimer regarding the use of our online PDF tools, service availability, limitations, and responsibility for uploaded files.";
}

<head>
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
</head>

<div class="card p-4">

    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>

    <p>
        The information and services provided on <strong>RatPDF</strong> are offered
        for general informational and utility purposes only.
    </p>

    <p>
        By using this website, you agree to the terms outlined in this disclaimer.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Service Accuracy</h3>

    <p>
        While we strive to ensure that our tools function correctly and efficiently,
        we do not guarantee that all services will be error-free, uninterrupted,
        or suitable for every file type.
    </p>

    <p>
        Users should verify important documents after processing them through
        our tools.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>No File Storage</h3>

    <p>
        RatPDF is designed to prioritize user privacy.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Files are processed locally within the user's browser.</li>
        <li>Documents are not stored on our servers.</li>
        <li>We do not retain or archive user files.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        Users remain fully responsible for managing and safeguarding their files.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>User Responsibility</h3>

    <p>
        Users are responsible for ensuring that they have the legal right to
        upload and process any documents used with our tools.
    </p>

    <p>
        You must not use RatPDF for processing illegal, copyrighted, or
        unauthorized materials without permission.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>External Links</h3>

    <p>
        Our website may contain links to third-party websites or services.
        We are not responsible for the content, policies, or practices
        of those external sites.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Limitation of Liability</h3>

    <p>
        RatPDF shall not be held liable for any direct, indirect, or
        consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use
        our website or tools.
    </p>

    <p>
        All services are provided on an <strong>"as-is"</strong> basis without
        any warranties of any kind.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Changes to This Disclaimer</h3>

    <p>
        We may update this disclaimer from time to time to reflect
        changes to our services or policies.
    </p>

    <p>
        Users are encouraged to review this page periodically.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Contact</h3>

    <p>
        If you have any questions regarding this disclaimer, please visit our
        <a href="/Home/Contact">Contact Page</a>.
    </p>

    <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> @DateTime.Now.Year</p>

</div>